+- id: AUG-144
+  title: 'AUG-144: spec bundle resolves a namespaced-corpus requirement, follows the
+    inverse verifies edge, and refuses an unknown id with its own typed code'
+  criteria:
+  - 'PROOF: PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH python3 -m pytest tests/test_xml_specs.py -k
+    bundle -q prints 9 passed and exits 0. FAILIF: any failure or error, or a passed
+    count other than 9.'
+  - 'PROOF: python3 auger.py spec bundle tests/fixtures/xml/specs AUG-REQ-014 exits
+    0 and its JSON names id AUG-REQ-014 with status ok and both nodes AUG-AC-014-1
+    and AUG-VER-014-1. FAILIF: nonzero exit, or either node id missing from the verifications
+    array.'
+  - 'PROOF: python3 auger.py spec bundle tests/fixtures/xml/specs AUG-NOT-A-REQUIREMENT
+    exits 2 and stderr carries the typed line spec error (unknown-requirement). FAILIF:
+    exit 0, or a diagnostic without that typed code.'
+  - 'PROOF: python3 auger.py spec check tests/fixtures/xml/specs exits 0 with status
+    valid and lists AUG-REQ-014 among its nodes, so check and bundle agree on the
+    same id. FAILIF: nonzero exit, status other than valid, or AUG-REQ-014 absent
+    from nodes.'
+  - 'PROOF: grep -c tests/test_xml_specs.py tests/gate.sh prints 2, so the regression
+    file is named in the gates pytest arm. FAILIF: a count below 2.'
+  status: in_progress
